#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House4/scripts.inc:22
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_House4_Text_AncientTreasuresWaitingInSea"
msgid ""
"Listen up, and I'll tell you something\n"
"good.\p"
"There's supposed to be an ancient\n"
"ruin in the sea around here.\p"
"There could be treasures just waiting\n"
"to be discovered down there.$"
msgstr ""
"听好了，\n"
"我告诉你一件好事。\p"
"据说这附近的海里\n"
"有一座古代遗迹。\p"
"说不定那下面\n"
"有等着被发现的宝藏呢。$"

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House4/scripts.inc:30
msgctxt "SootopolisCity_House4_Text_StrollUnderwaterWithPokemon"
msgid ""
"Ancient treasures…\p"
"It would be nice if they existed, but\n"
"even if they didn't, it would be so\l"
"beautiful to take an underwater\l"
"stroll with my POKéMON.$"
msgstr ""
"古代的宝藏……\p"
"如果真的有就好了，\n"
"不过就算没有，\l"
"和宝可梦一起在海底散步\l"
"也一定会很美吧。$"

#: data/maps/SootopolisCity_House4/scripts.inc:37
